    "text": "52 minutes ago The women of Alpha Kappa Alpha Sorority Inc., Delta Omega Omega Chapter, recently concluded their Reactivation Month filled with purpose energy, and heartfelt reconnections, according to a news release. Chapter President Kelli Dixon expressed her appreciation to all members, both active and newly reactivated, for their dedication and sisterly spirit. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
